WEBVTT

00:09:26.514 --> 00:09:30.276
And cloudspotting
legitimizes doing nothing.

00:09:30.300 --> 00:09:32.181
(Laughter)

00:09:32.205 --> 00:09:34.833
And sometimes we need —

00:09:34.857 --> 00:09:40.441
(Applause)

00:09:40.465 --> 00:09:44.524
Sometimes we need excuses to do nothing.

00:09:44.548 --> 00:09:47.306
We need to be reminded by these

00:09:47.330 --> 00:09:50.838
patron goddesses of idle fellows

00:09:50.862 --> 00:09:53.813
that slowing down

00:09:53.837 --> 00:09:57.616
and being in the present,
not thinking about

00:09:57.640 --> 00:10:00.470
what you've got to do
and what you should have done,